---
title: Research chat interactions
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Operator
    participant T as Telegram chat
    participant B as Bot service
    participant A as Analyst router
    participant M as Meta Model API
    participant R as Meta reason
    participant S as Snapshot store
    participant J as Journal

    U->>T: Send voice note
    T->>B: Forward audio
    B->>M: Transcribe audio
    M-->>B: Return transcript
    B->>J: Journal transcript
    B->>A: Route as chat query
    A->>S: Read latest ChainSnapshot
    S-->>A: Return snapshot
    A-->>B: Return brief text
    B->>T: Send reply
    T->>U: Show brief

    U->>T: Ask for GEX brief
    T->>B: Forward command
    B->>A: Run tool call
    A->>S: Read latest ChainSnapshot
    S-->>A: Return snapshot
    alt Model key and budget set
        A->>M: Spark tool call with snapshot
        M-->>A: Return thesis
        A->>J: Journal ModelReceipt
    else Fallback
        A->>A: Deterministic flip rule
    end
    Note over A,M: Grounding on enriches the thesis
    A->>J: Journal signal
    A-->>B: Return brief text
    B->>T: Send reply
    T->>U: Show brief

    U->>T: Ask for trade cards
    T->>B: Forward command
    B->>A: Route cards request
    A->>S: Read latest ChainSnapshot
    S-->>A: Return snapshot
    alt Reason model set
        A->>R: Request card reasons
        R-->>A: Return reasons
        A->>J: Journal trade_card_reason
    else Fallback
        A->>A: Offline reason fallback
        A->>J: Journal reason_fallback
    end
    A-->>B: Return cards text
    B->>T: Send cards reply
    T->>U: Show trade cards

    Note over B,S: Scheduled brief runs on cron or launchd
    B->>A: Trigger session brief
    A->>S: Read latest ChainSnapshot
    S-->>A: Return snapshot
    A-->>B: Return brief text
    B->>T: Push brief
    T->>U: Show brief
